{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.ofName?\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">ofName?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The scheme with the IANA charset name or alias `s`, ignoring ASCII case: `UTF-8`, `UTF-16BE`,\n`UTF-16LE`, `UTF-16`, `UTF-32BE`, `UTF-32LE` and `UTF-32`, and their aliases `csUTF8`,\n`csUTF16BE` and so on. `UTF-8` is `utf8`, and `UTF-16` and `UTF-32` are `utf16 .big` and\n`utf32 .big`, which read a byte order mark if there is one.\n\nThe labels of the WHATWG Encoding Standard are not names here: some of them conflict with IANA\nnames, such as `utf-16`, which WHATWG takes as UTF-16LE, and WHATWG decoding follows a byte order\nmark whatever the label.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.ofName?","kind":"def","line":280,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.ofName?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L280-L299"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.name\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">name</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The IANA charset name of the scheme `e`: `\"UTF-8\"`, `\"UTF-16BE\"`, `\"UTF-16LE\"`, `\"UTF-16\"`,\n`\"UTF-32BE\"`, `\"UTF-32LE\"` or `\"UTF-32\"`. UTF-8 with a signature has no name of its own, and the\nnames of the UTF-16 and UTF-32 schemes do not tell the byte order of `utf16 o` and `utf32 o`.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.name","kind":"def","line":265,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.name","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L265-L278"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.detect?\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">detect?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The scheme given by the byte order mark or UTF-8 signature at the start of `b`, if there is one:\n`utf8BOM`, `utf16 o` or `utf32 o`, so decoding `b` in that scheme skips the mark. The bytes\nFF FE 00 00 start both UTF-32LE with a byte order mark and UTF-16LE with a byte order mark followed\nby U+0000; they are taken as UTF-32LE, as is usual.\n\nOnly the mark counts: without one, the result is `none`, even for bytes that are plainly not UTF-8,\nsuch as UTF-16 or UTF-32 text without a mark. Callers then choose the scheme, often `utf8`.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.detect?","kind":"def","line":248,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.detect?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L248-L263"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcodeLossy\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">transcodeLossy</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src </span><span class=\"fn\">dst</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Converts `b` from the scheme `src` to the scheme `dst`, replacing each ill-formed code unit\nwith U+FFFD, or in UTF-8 each maximal subpart of an ill-formed byte sequence.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcodeLossy","kind":"def","line":241,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcodeLossy","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L241-L244"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcode?\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">transcode?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src </span><span class=\"fn\">dst</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Converts `b` from the scheme `src` to the scheme `dst`, or returns `none` if `b` is ill-formed\nin `src`.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcode?","kind":"def","line":236,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcode?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L236-L239"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcode\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">transcode</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src </span><span class=\"fn\">dst</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Except\">Except</a> <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/Iterator/Basic.html#Unicode.DecodeError\">DecodeError</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Converts `b` from the scheme `src` to the scheme `dst`, or returns the first ill-formed input\nin `src` with its byte offset in `b`.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcode","kind":"def","line":231,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.transcode","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L231-L234"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.validate\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">validate</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `b` is well-formed in the scheme `e`.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.validate","kind":"def","line":219,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.validate","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L219-L229"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decodeLossy\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">decodeLossy</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decodes `b` in the scheme `e`, replacing each ill-formed code unit with U+FFFD, or in UTF-8 each\nmaximal subpart of an ill-formed byte sequence.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decodeLossy","kind":"def","line":206,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.decodeLossy","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L206-L217"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode!\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">decode!</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decodes `b` in the scheme `e`, panicking if `b` is ill-formed.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode!","kind":"def","line":190,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode!","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L190-L194"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode?\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">decode?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decodes `b` in the scheme `e`, or returns `none` if `b` is ill-formed.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode?","kind":"def","line":187,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L187-L188"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">decode</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Except\">Except</a> <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/Iterator/Basic.html#Unicode.DecodeError\">DecodeError</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decodes `b` in the scheme `e`, or returns the first ill-formed input with its byte offset in\n`b`.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode","kind":"def","line":171,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.decode","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L171-L185"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.encode\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">encode</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The encoding of `s` in the scheme `e`.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.encode","kind":"def","line":138,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.encode","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L138-L148"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.instReprEncodingScheme.repr\"><span class=\"name\