</span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.instInhabitedEncodingScheme","kind":"instance","line":69,"name":"Unicode.instInhabitedEncodingScheme","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L69-L69"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.utf32\"><span class=\"name\">Unicode</span>.<span class=\"name\">EncodingScheme</span>.<span class=\"name\">utf32</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">order</span> : <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/Basic.html#Unicode.ByteOrder\">ByteOrder</a> := <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/Basic.html#Unicode.ByteOrder.big\">ByteOrder.big</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme\">EncodingScheme</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"UTF-32 with a byte order mark. Encoding writes the mark, then the code units in byte order\n`order`. Decoding follows the mark, or reads in byte order `order` if there is none; the Standard\ncalls for big-endian, the default.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.utf32","kind":"ctor","line":63,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.utf32","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/EncodingScheme.lean#L63-L68"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\